Well... it's complicated. First Eru Iluvatar, Father of Everything,
created the Ainur. Most powerful of these were the Valar; and one of
those was Elbereth. Then Eru created the Earth, to edify and amuse the
Ainur. The Valar, including Elbereth, went to form the Earth, which was
unformed and bare, into the planet as we know it (with the aid of a few
major catastrophes), and rule it.
So depending on whether you see the Valar as the seconds-in-command of
Eru, or as the Lords of the Earth, Elbereth is either a goddess or an
arch-angel. An elf she certainly isn't.

